{
  "info": {
    "name": "Traffic Processing Platform API",
    "description": "API collection for CnSS REST and WebSocket endpoints. Includes placeholders for environment variables.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"access_token\", jsonData.access_token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"secretpassword\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://{{cnss_host}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["{{cnss_host}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Authenticate user and issue JWT token. On success, automatically saves the token to the `access_token` collection variable."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "REST Endpoints",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://{{cnss_host}}/api/v1/health",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["{{cnss_host}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "health"]
            },
            "description": "Verify operational status of the CnSS and aggregate channel statistics."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Channels",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://{{cnss_host}}/api/v1/channels",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["{{cnss_host}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "channels"]
            },
            "description": "List all channels accessible to the authenticated user (filtered by JWT scope for viewers)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Channel Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://{{cnss_host}}/api/v1/channel/{{channel_id}}/status",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["{{cnss_host}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "channel", "{{channel_id}}", "status"]
            },
            "description": "REST fallback for a specific channel's activity indicator."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "WebSocket Endpoints",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Real-time Telemetry Stream",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "wss://{{cnss_host}}:{{cnss_ws_port}}/api/v1/ws/telemetry?token={{access_token}}&channel_id={{channel_id}}",
              "protocol": "wss",
              "host": ["{{cnss_host}}:{{cnss_ws_port}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "ws", "telemetry"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "channel_id",
                  "value": "{{channel_id}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Connect to this WebSocket endpoint to receive real-time telemetry updates for a specific channel.\n\n**Connection Lifecycle & Close Codes:**\n- Auth via query parameters `?token={{access_token}}&channel_id={{channel_id}}`.\n- Close codes: `4001` (invalid_token), `4002` (missing_channel: query parameter absent), `4003` (channel_forbidden), `4004` (channel_not_found: query parameter value not in registry).\n- CnSS pushes `telemetry_update` frames (2-10 Hz).\n- **Keep-Alive:** CnSS sends periodic `ping` frames. MUI must respond with `pong`.\n- If no telemetry from CN for 5000ms, CnSS sends `is_active: false`.\n\n*Security Note: CnSS MUST NOT log the full request URL to prevent token leakage.*"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "cnss_host",
      "value": "cnss.example.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "cnss_udp_port",
      "value": "5140",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "cnss_ws_port",
      "value": "8443",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": "eyJhbG...",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "channel_id",
      "value": "bridge-berlin-01",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}